        "text": "Return ONLY valid JSON.\nDo NOT include explanations, markdown, or extra fields.\nDo NOT wrap JSON in quotes or code blocks.\n\nExpected format:\n{\n  \"technologies\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"\",\n      \"category\": \"\",\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"releaseDate\": \"\",\n      \"keyFeatures\": [],\n      \"source\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"\"\n}",
